  "prompt": "For web order lines (channel 'web') in 2025 (order_date from 1 January 2025 to 31 December 2025, both days included), return three columns, in this order: n_orders (the number of different orders), avg_lines_per_order (order lines per order) and avg_units_per_order (units sold per order). Every line counts as a line, even one with a missing units value, and a missing units value adds no units. Use exactly these column names. Do not round. The result is a single row. Any row order is fine.",
